B.Wd=new A.c6("melee_ancient","Ancient","On Player Failure, Allies within {Level} have Resistance to attacks as if they had this unit's defenses. On Player Success, allies within 1 have Resistance to attacks as if they had this unit's defenses.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.Wa=new A.c6("melee_berserker","Berserker","On Player Failure, Knock the target prone, deal {Level/3} d6 extra damage, and Until the start of their next turn, the chump has resistance to all damage.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends its turn range 1, make a Berserker attack.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.VL=new A.c6("melee_challenger","Challenger","On Player Failure, the target cannot disengage and must include this unit as a target of all attacks or suffer disadvantage on their next turn. On Failure, Target a player that they can see and have them make a Wis defense, On Player Failure, they are challenged as if attacked.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.VN=new A.c6("melee_defender","Defender","On Player Failure, players have -1 to attacks against this chump and their adjacent allies until the start of their next turn. On Player Success, players have -1 to attack against this chump's allies who are range 1 of this defender.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.W7=new A.c6("melee_feasting","Feasting","On Player Failure, Heal half the damage they deal and knock the target prone. If the target dies or the first time they feast on a dead body, heal the full amount.\n[Reaction] When an enemy dies or is knocked prone within half speed, dash to a space adjacent to the target and make a Feasting Attack against the target or an enemy range 1.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.VR=new A.c6("melee_frozen","Frozen","On Player Failure, The target and enemies adjacent to either the target or you, gains {Level/3} Cold.\n[Reaction] When a Player Succeeds an attack against the chump and they resist the damage, give {Level/4} cold to enemies adjacent to the chump.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.W0=new A.c6("melee_guard","Guard","On Player Failure, During the target's next turn their speed is 0.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes adjacent, make the guard attack, the effect applies to their current turn.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.VW=new A.c6("melee_paladin","Paladin","On Player Failure, heal an ally equal to half the damage dealt.\n[Reaction] During an adjacent ally's turn, you may reduce this chump's HP and give it to that ally.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.VU=new A.c6("melee_stampeding","Stampeding","Instead, Move up to half their speed, moving through enemies. Each target makes a Dex Defense, On Player Failure, they take {Damage} and are knocked prone.\n[Reaction] After a Player Succeeds an Attack against them, you may have them stamped.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.VJ=new A.c6("melee_valorous","Valorous","On Player Failure, this chump resists all damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range {Level} is successfully attacked and that attack didn't include this chump as a target, this chump takes the damage instead of the target. Effects still target the original character.",B.cj,B.dl)
B.dL=new A.kY(1,"controller")
B.We=new A.c6("melee_bully","Bully","On Player Failure, knock them prone.\n[Reaction] When an ally attacks a player in range, make the bully attack.",B.cj,B.dL)
B.VS=new A.c6("melee_grabber","Grabber","On Player Failure, the target is grappled.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a grabbing attack.",B.cj,B.dL)
B.W5=new A.c6("melee_scoundrel","Scoundrel","On Player Failure, Half the targets speed and knock them prone.\n[Reaction] The first time an enemy starts or becomes range 3 during their turn, make a scoundrel attack against the target.",B.cj,B.dL)
B.VD=new A.c6("melee_toxic","Toxic","On Player Failure, The target gain {Level/3} d8 Burn vs Vit, While they have this burn, halve their speed.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends in range 3 during their turn, make a toxic attack against the target.",B.cj,B.dL)
B.cK=new A.kY(2,"killThreat")
B.VP=new A.c6("melee_striker","Striker","On Player success, deal half damage.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends their turn in range, make an attack.",B.cj,B.cK)
B.W_=new A.c6("melee_skirmisher","Skirmisher","Regardless of Success, after damage this unit dashes their speed.\n[Reaction] When a player first becomes adjacent during their turn, they must make a Wis defense or this unit dashes half their speed.",B.cj,B.cK)
B.W2=new A.c6("melee_flurry","Flurry","Instead, target all adjacent enemies.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends their turn in range, make a Flurry Attack.",B.cj,B.cK)
B.VO=new A.c6("melee_bloody","Bloody","On Player Failure, the target gain {Half Level} d6 Bleed, and You may deal {Half Level d6} damage to the chump to give all enemies adjacent to the target or the chump {Half Level} d6 bleed.\n[Reaction] At the end of a turn, you may deal {Half Level d6} damage to the chump and give all enemies adjacent to them {Half Level} d6 Bleed.",B.cj,B.cK)
B.Wo=new A.c6("melee_ignitor","Ignitor","On Player Failure, the target gain {Half Level} d6 Burn vs Dex.\n[Reaction] At the end of the round, give the chump and all characters range 3 of them {Level} d6 burn.",B.cj,B.cK)
B.Wl=new A.c6("melee_parasite","Parasite","On Player Failure, instead give the target {Half Level} d6 Bleed then the chump attaches to the Target. While attached, players cannot target the chump and the chump shares a space with the target. The Chump heals half of all bleed damage the target takes. At the Start of the Target's turn, they must make a Vit Defense. On Player Failure, they take {Basic Damage} damage and gain 1 d6 Bleed. On Player Success, the effect ends and the chump is in an adjacent location.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a parasite attack.",B.cj,B.cK)
B.eo=new A.p6(1,"ranged")
B.Wn=new A.c6("ranged_suppressor","Suppressor","On Player Failure, on the target's next turn, half their speed and they cannot retreat. On player success, they are slowed by 1 and cannot retreat.",B.eo,B.dL)
B.VG=new A.c6("ranged_disabler","Disabler","On Player Failure, the target is disabled during their next turn.\n[Reaction] When a player ends their turn in range 6, Make the Disabler attack.",B.eo,B.dL)
B.Wc=new A.c6("ranged_jammer","Jammer","On Player Failure, enemies within 6 of the unit have -1 to all dice checks. On player success when in the short range, the target has -1 to all dice checks",B.eo,B.dL)
B.VX=new A.c6("ranged_blasting","Blasting","Regardless of success, push the target {Half Level}.",B.eo,B.dL)
B.VY=new A.c6("ranged_mind_control","Mind Control","On Player Failure, deal half damage and the target is mind controlled. On their next turn, they must attack one of their allies using one of their features.\n[Reaction] When an ally range 6 succeeds in an attack, make the target make a Wis Defense. On Player Failure, the target is mind controlled.",B.eo,B.dL)
B.VQ=new A.c6("ranged_sniper","Sniper","On Player Success, deal half damage.\n[Reaction] When a player first enters or starts in range, make an attack.",B.eo,B.cK)
B.VM=new A.c6("ranged_harasser","Harasser","Regardless, they dash half their speed.\n[Reaction] When a player first becomes adjacent during their turn, they must make a Wis defense or this unit dashes half their speed.",B.eo,B.cK)
B.Wq=new A.c6("ranged_aoe","AOE","Instead target a {Level/3} space radius.\n[Reaction] At the end of the round, make an attack.",B.eo,B.cK)
B.Wf=new A.c6("ranged_poisoner","Poisoner","On Player Failure, They must make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range 1 succeeds on an attack, cause the targets to make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} extra damage.",B.eo,B.cK)
B.Wb=new A.c6("ranged_burn","Burn","On Player Failure, they gain {Half Level} d6 Burn.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes range 1, give the chump and all characters range 1 {Half Level} d6 burn.",B.eo,B.cK)
B.VH=new A.c6("ranged_sacrifice","Sacrifice","On Player Failure, They gain {Half Level} d6 Bleed.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes range 1, Give the chump up to {Level} d6 bleed and give an enemy the same amount.",B.eo,B.cK)
B.iR=new A.p6(2,"healer")
B.hI=new A.kY(3,"support")
B.W6=new A.c6("healer_doctor","Doctor","On Failure, heal the target for half.\n[Reaction] When an ally becomes adjacent during their turn, make a healing check.",B.iR,B.hI)
B.VZ=new A.c6("healer_paramedic","Paramedic","On Failure, heal the target for Half. On Success, end all bleed, burn, and cold.\n[Reaction] When an ally starts or becomes adjacent, end all bleed, burn, and cold.",B.iR,B.hI)
B.VF=new A.c6("healer_saint","Saint","Instead, Target any chump in the encounter.\n[Reaction] After an ally takes damage, make a heal check targeting them. This healing can prevent death.",B.iR,B.hI)
B.Wh=new A.c6("healer_regenerator","Regenerator","On Success, instead, until the start of their next turn, when an ally starts or becomes within {Level} spaces, they heal {Half of Basic Damage roll}.\n[Reaction] When an Ally starts their turn range {Level}, heal them {Half of Basic Damage roll}.",B.iR,B.hI)
B.Wk=new A.c6("healer_shielder","Shielder","On success, give allies range {Level} half the heal result worth of shield. On Failure, they gain half shields instead.",B.iR,B.hI)
B.VV=new A.c6("healer_nova","Nova","Instead, target allies range 4.\n[Reaction] When an ally starts or becomes range 4, take the Heal action.",B.iR,B.hI)
B.dM=new A.p6(3,"leader")
B.Wg=new A.c6("leader_shield","Shield","The chump and their allies range {Level /3} gains {Basic Damage} shield.",B.dM,B.dl)
B.VT=new A.c6("leader_rally","Rally","The chump and allies range {Level} heal {Half Basic Damage Dice}.",B.dM,B.dl)
B.W4=new A.c6("leader_defense","Defense","The enemies have a -1 to attacks against the Chump and their allies range {Half Level} until the start of the target's next turn.",B.dM,B.dl)
B.W8=new A.c6("leader_challenge","Challenge","Players range {Level} of the target chump must include the target on their next attack or suffer disadvantage until the start of the target's next turn.",B.dM,B.dl)
B.W1=new A.c6("leader_bleed","Bleed","The chump gives a player in range of the chump action {Level} d6 bleed.\n[Reaction] On Movement, the chump gives the bleed to a player range {Level} after moving.",B.dM,B.cK)
B.VI=new A.c6("leader_burn","Burn","The chump gives a player in range of the chump action {Level} d6 burn. Choose the defense targeted when you take this.\n[Reaction] On Movement, the chump gives the burn to a player range {Level} after moving.",B.dM,B.cK)
B.Wm=new A.c6("leader_dangerous","Dangerous","Deal {Basic Damage} to a player in range of the triggering ability.\n[Reaction] On Movement, target a player range {Level} of the chump and deal {Basic Damage}.",B.dM,B.cK)
B.Wp=new A.c6("leader_plague","Plague","Players range {Level} of the target need to make a Vit Defense, On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} damage.",B.dM,B.cK)
B.Wi=new A.c6("leader_rot","Rot","On the target's next successful attack, the targeted players halve all healing they receive until the end of their next turn. Healers instead, the next time they succeed at healing, give this buff to all healed targets.",B.dM,B.cK)
B.Wj=new A.c6("leader_cold","Cold","On the target's next successful attack, the targeted players gain {Level/3} cold. Healers instead, the next time they successfully heal, give the targets this buff.",B.dM,B.dL)
B.VE=new A.c6("leader_suppression","Suppression","On the target's next successful attack, the targeted players have their speed halved and cannot retreat on their next turn. Healers instead, the next time they successfully heal, give the targets this buff.",B.dM,B.dL)
B.VK=new A.c6("leader_push","Push","Push any players up to range {Level} of the target so that they are 1 space outside the select range. You may also push allies.",B.dM,B.dL)
B.W3=new A.c6("leader_curse","Curse","On the target's next successful attack, the targeted players gain -1 to all dice checks until the end of their next turn. Healers instead, the next time they successfully heal, give the targets this buff.",B.dM,B.dL)
B.VC=new A.p6(4,"summoner")
