B.aB5=new A.fR("Harm",B.db,"Target 1 Enemy, On Success, Deal {Power d8} Damage to a defense that makes sense, generally the same as stat the skill uses. You may Reduce the damage to {Power d6} to target a 1 space radius instead.",B.amY)
B.amP=s(["Pay 1 supply to target allies instead."],t.s)
B.aB7=new A.fR("Help",B.db,"Give an ally advantage on any success checks until the start of your next turn.",B.amP)
B.akN=s(["Pay 1 supply to target all allies in a 1 space radius range 3, not including you."],t.s)
B.aBb=new A.fR("FirstAid",B.db,"Target 1 ally or yourself. On Success, Heal one ally (their Vitality)d6 HP. When you target yourself, gain disadvantage on the check unless you spend a supply.",B.akN)
B.ai0=s(["Pay 1 supply to target all your allies instead.","Pay 1 supply to use a reaction at the end of an ally's turn to take the action."],t.s)
B.aBa=new A.fR("Treatment",B.db,"Target 1 ally suffering from a status, On Success the target makes a check to end the effect with a +1 to results.",B.ai0)
B.ai4=s(["Pay 1 supply to target a 1 space area instead."],t.s)
B.aB3=new A.fR("Shield",B.db,"Target 1 ally or yourself, On Success The target gains {Power d8} Shield.",B.ai4)
B.aAZ=new A.fR("Use Item, Ranged",B.db,"When performing an Item Interaction that doesn't require a success check, Make a Skill check, On Success you may perform that item interaction at Range {Power}.",B.E)
B.o3=s(["Pay 1 supply to target all enemies in a 1 space radius instead."],t.s)
B.aB4=new A.fR("Restrain",B.db,"Target 1 Enemy, On Success, the target is restrained until the start of the next turn. You may concentrate on the effect but it then lasts as long as you are concentrating. You may apply it as a status check, end when failure. You may not concentrate and status check.",B.o3)
B.aBd=new A.a4z(1,"reaction")
B.anP=s(["Pay 1 supply to target any enemies range {Power} instead.","Pay 1 supply to have advantage on the check."],t.s)
B.aB_=new A.fR("Duel",B.aBd,"[Reaction] After making an attack regardless of success, you may spend your reaction and make a skill check. On Success, until the start of next turn, the target has disadvantage on attacks that do not include you as a target and you have disadvantage on attacks that do not include the target as a target. You may spend an action instead of a bonus to gain free supply to spend on upgrading the ability.",B.anP)
B.aB9=new A.fR("Disabled",B.db,"On Success, the target is Disabled until the start of the next turn.",B.o3)
B.aB2=new A.fR("Disabled Attacks",B.db,"On Success, the target's attacks fail until they either spend an action to end the effect or a reaction during their turn and succeed a skill check.",B.o3)
B.aBc=new A.fR("Slowed",B.db,"On Success, the target's speed is reduced by {Power}.",B.o3)
B.ajt=s(["Pay 1 supply to target any creatures in a 1 space radius instead; you choose which creatures in the area to target."],t.s)
B.aAY=new A.fR("Move",B.db,"Target one creature. On Success, move the target up to {Power} spaces to a free space, or the creature gains a +{Power} Bonus to speed till the end of their turn.",B.ajt)
B.aB0=new A.fR("Information",B.db,"On Success, gain an important trait of an enemy, or a health estimate of an enemy, or any new useful information. DM decides how much detail to give. For health estimates, tell them the health remaining and use ranges like Healthy, Wounded, Near Death when players ask without a check.",B.E)
