B.aPg=new A.bG("weapon_ranged_shotgun","ShotGun",B.bs,"Being adjacent to enemies does not give you disadvantage with Shotgun, but allies provide cover to enemies. When the target is at short range, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","3 / 6","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aPd=new A.bG("weapon_ranged_rifle","Rifle",B.bs,"On Success, If you haven't moved or dashed this turn, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","10 / 20","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
