s($,"cwm","nH",()=>A.a([A.bj("Spend a Method: You deliver vehicles, sheds, machines, and anything you could conceivably launch. You can launch the whole party as a volley.","When you perform [Action], you may have it instead target a 1 space radius and have the ability trigger at the end of the round instead. If you do, increase the damage by {Half Level d10} and increase any healing or shielding by {Half level d10}.","epic_method_artillery","Epic Artillery","method_artillery",B.ar),A.bj("Your fans are ravenous for your work. As soon as it's posted about, they swarm the location to see it.","The first time an ally becomes in range of an artwork during their turn, they gain {Half Level d6} shield and gain advantage on any check on their next action.","epic_method_artist","Epic Artist","method_artist",B.ar),A.bj("When you use your aside, the target forgets about your allies and only remembers you.","While concentrating, no other character can affect or target either you or the target. When you activate Aside, you and the target end all effects caused by other characters in the situation.","epic_method_aside","Epic Aside","method_aside",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: Your assistant can bring you a supply.","You can choose to have your Assistant heal you {Level d10} or end Burn, Bleed.","epic_method_assistant","Epic Assistant","method_assistant",B.ar),A.bj("You may spend a usage to make your hack target perform a single check using your skills, then end the hack.","You may use the location of any enemy you see as the origin for targeting [actions] and [Reaction]. If you do and succeed on an attack, you apply your body hacker effect to the origin enemy until the start of your next turn.","epic_method_body_hacker","Epic Body Hacker","method_body_hacker",B.ar),A.bj("The first time you would use supply in each situation, have someone give you what you needed and don't spend supply. You must explain why they owed you a favor appropriate to what you requested.","When you activate Charitable, target 1 enemy who can hear you. They cannot make an attack or skill until you do, or they are targeted by an attack.","epic_method_charitable","Epic Charitable","method_charitable",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: You create a delicious meal that people are compelled to eat. Eating the meal is completely distracting and causes the eater to enter a food coma and fall asleep unless harmed or physically awakened.","Eating a snack also gives {Half Level d12} regeneration. While the target has this regeneration they ignore either their stress or exhaustion.","epic_method_chef","Epic Chef","method_chef",B.ar),A.bj("Whenever you chill, your allies start the next situation with a {Level d12} shield.","On each of your turns, If the first check you make is a skill, gain {Half Level} bonus to speed until the start of your next turn. If the first check is a defense, after taking damage, gain a {Half Level d6} shield.","epic_method_chill","Epic Chill","method_chill",B.ar),A.bj("After using Dark Forces, you have +1 to checks for the remainder of the scene or situation.","While you are under the effect of a dark force's negative effect, you have resistance to damage. While under the effect, the first time you die each situation, you instead set your Health to half.","epic_method_dark_forces","Epic Dark Forces","method_dark_forces",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: Kill a character you can see. Describe how you did it in a way that was clear you did it.","whenever you miss with an attack, gain 1d6 extra damage on all attacks until the end of the situation, to a max of {Level} d6. When you miss and are at max trigger your deathweaver instead. Whenever an enemy range {Half Level} dies, gain {1d6} as if you had missed. You start each situation with {power} d6.","epic_method_death_weaver","Epic Death Weaver","method_death_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("You may decide an exact moment and both targets suffer the doom at the same time.","Your attacks against the doomed targets have advantage. Your status checks to heal and shield doomed targets have advantage.","epic_method_doom","Epic Doom","method_doom",B.ar),A.bj("When you disappear, you teleport a short distance.","On use, You teleport to a free space range {Level} and teleport again at the start of your next turn before checking if you're concealed.","epic_method_disappear","Epic Disappear","method_disappear",B.ar),A.bj("You or your allies with your consent can use 1 of your methods to deploy a drone. Drones are Medium Pawn Chumps who use your defenses. When you deploy it, choose one of your skills that you are proficient with. The drone can only use that skill. You do not need to be present in the scene for allies to use a drone.","You gain {Half Level} drones to use for the situation. When you use a drone, target yourself & allies range 2 of the drone space and they gain {Half Level d8} shield.","epic_method_drone","Epic Drone","method_drone",B.ar),A.bj("Use a method: set fire to any building, room, or vehicle you can see on fire. You cannot conceal that you started the fire. You may grow any existing fire to be the size of a building, room, or vehicle, and you may conceal that you fueled the fire.","whenever you hit a creature with an attack, Use a Method: set 1 space under them on fire. While on fire, the first time a creature starts or enters the fire during their turn, they gain {Level/3} d6 Burn. A character can put out 1 adjacent fire using an action.","epic_method_fire_weaver","Epic Fire Weaver","method_fire_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("On use, You may have the owner, manager or authority that this location be a casual friend of yours.","When you are attacked by an enemy you haven\u2019t attacked in this situation, Use a Method: You use Cha defense instead of the normal defense.","epic_method_friends","Epic Friends","method_friends",B.ar),A.bj("You choose when to reveal your allies. Before they are revealed, they are invisible and cannot be revealed nor interact with reality. They may end the effect at any time.","Whenever an ally starts or becomes out of sight of enemies, you may target them with your Friends in the Shadows. Whenever you teleport an ally using friends in the shadows, the ally gains {Half Level} speed until the end of their turn.","epic_method_friends_in_the_shadows","Epic Friends in the Shadows","method_friends_in_the_shadows",B.ar),A.bj("Whenever you fail a check, gain 1 goon. Goons roll d8s on checks instead.\nWhenever a goon fails a check, you may spend a goon to reroll the check. You may do this any number of times but must get increasingly annoyed with the number of goons required.","Goons are Large sized. When an enemy starts its turn grappled with a goon, they take {Half Level d6} damage.","epic_method_goons","Epic Goons","method_goons",B.ar),A.bj("You can make any lock fail and fall open.","When you activate gremlin, you may target every enemy you see instead. If you do, you must also target 1 ally in the situation.","epic_method_gremlin","Epic Gremlin","method_gremlin",B.ar),A.bj("You can also teleport to the target after seeing their location.","End of round, if you damaged an enemy this round, heal {Half Level d6}. Whenever you succeed an attack, you may roll and take up to {Half level dice} worth of damage to that much bonus damage on the attack to the targets. You pick the dice. If you do not survive the cost, the attack succeeds before you die.","epic_method_hemomancer","Epic Hemomancer","method_hemomancer",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: You cause an ice storm in the area. You may also have a free character you can touch solid. They are frozen in time until they thaw.","After activating any enemy with Cold from you, it takes {1d12} damage for each Cold they have. Any character who is frozen by you, deal {their Vitality d12} to them.","epic_method_ice_weaver","Epic Ice Weaver","method_ice_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: You make someone so irritated, that they are stunned with temporary anger and are unable to do anything.","While concentrating on irritation, enemies within {Level /3} must target you if able.","epic_method_irritation","Epic Irritation","method_irritation",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: You heal a destroyed body so that its user can reconnect.","you may target your [actions] and [Reactions] using any allies or willing creatures you can see.\nWhen you succeed on a check using your Action, heal 1 ally range 4 {half level d8} health.","epic_method_life_weaver","Epic Life Weaver","method_life_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: Cause a lightning storm that takes out the power of building within a mile and interferes with ships.","whenever you succeed in attacking an enemy, knock the targets prone. If they are already prone or the attack already causes prone, deal {Half Level d10} damage.","epic_method_lightning_weaver","Epic Lightning Weaver","method_lightning_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("Every Scene & Situation, you may make yourself appear as an advertisement, concealing your identity to passersby.","When an enemy you can see makes an attack vs Str, Dex, Vit, or Cha, Use a Method: give you and all your allies advantage on defending the attack.","epic_method_marketing","Epic Marketing","method_marketing",B.ar),A.bj("When you use Martial Artist, you may use it for all defenses caused by the source of the original defense until the end of the scene. Allies who can see you may spend a method when they would make a defense to make an attack instead.","whenever you succeed in attacking an enemy using your [Action] or [Reaction], Make a Melee Attack vs Str or Dex targeting 1 enemy range 1. On Success, Deal {Level d6} damage.","epic_method_martial_artist","Epic Martial Artist","method_martial_artist",B.ar),A.bj("You create a {Level} minions instead of one, gaining advantage on the check.","Your undead are large and you have +1 to defenses made for the undead. Whenever your undead deals damage, you heal {Level d6}.","epic_method_necromancer","Epic Necromancer","method_necromancer",B.ar),A.bj("For the remainder of the scene, all of your party can communicate to you and hear you.","After the offline chat give all party members either +1 to attack, Defenses, or Skills for the rest of the situation. If you trigger this multiple times, they choose which effect they would like, but do not gain the effect of more than one.","epic_method_offline_chat","Epic Offline Chat","method_offline_chat",B.ar),A.bj("Use a method: Describe and play as a grandparent who shames a character you can see for not supporting a cause of your choice. This either distracts them or gives you advantage on your next convince check to get them to help your cause.","Use a Method: You gain a mob of rioters for as long as you remain concentrating. Spaces within {Level /3} of you are difficult terrain. Whenever an enemy ends their turn in the mob, they take {Level /3 d6}.","epic_method_oppose","Epic Oppose","method_oppose",B.ar),A.bj("Witnesses of your form will slowly become obsessed, seeking out evidence of what happened and then coming to you seeking the truth bringing all of the proof they could find.","While concentrating on otherworldly, You do not provoke attacks and may move through enemy spaces. After an enemy is damaged by your Otherworldly, until the end of their next turn, you and your allies have +1 to Str, Dex, or Vit defense.","epic_method_otherworldly","Epic Otherworldly","method_otherworldly",B.ar),A.bj("You may target you and all allies in the scene with your overlock instead.\nUse a Method: Cause a character you can see to become overclocked, becoming over reactive.","When a target overclocks, when the target succeeds an attack, they may roll taking {Vitality} d6 damage and deal the same amount to the targets. You may do the same when rolling for healing and shield.","epic_method_overclock","Epic Overclock","method_overclock",B.ar),A.bj("The first defense you make in a scene has advantage and doesn\u2019t count as a check for the purposes of your Phasing adventuring power.","You gain resistance to all damage vs Str, Dex, or Vit. You resist all damage until you make your first attack or skill check in a situation. You may teleport up to your speed instead of walking.","epic_method_phasing","Epic Phasing","method_phasing",B.ar),A.bj("When you pocket sand, you also turn into a cloud of sand for a minute. While sand, you cannot be targeted, you can fly and you can move through anything a cloud could. The sand condenses after a minute and reforms into your body, teleporting if necessary.","When you use pocket sand, you also turn into a pile of sand until the start of your next turn or as long as you concentrate. While sand, you may move through enemies, you don\u2019t provoke attacks, and advantage on defenses. Checks to heal you have disadvantage.","epic_method_pocket_sand","Epic Pocket Sand","method_pocket_sand",B.ar),A.bj("The effect of your poison can last for days and be deadly. When you activate poisoner, you can poison all of the food or beverages in the room.","On use, you instead target enemies within {Level / 3}. Pick another effect to add to your poison.","epic_method_poisoner","Epic Poisoner","method_poisoner",B.ar),A.bj("When an ally fails a defense in a scene where you're not present, Use a method: teleport adjacent to the ally and become the target suffering the ill effects instead.","Whenever an ally within {Half Level} is damaged by an attack, you can take that damage instead.\nWhen you lose shield and protection as a result of taking damage, for each 1 lost reduce the damage by 2. This has no effect on abilities that have you pay, or lose shields.","epic_method_protector","Epic Protector","method_protector",B.ar),A.bj("Whenever an ally fails to convince, Use a Method: they may call you and have you attempt to convince on behalf of your client.","When an enemy you can see would target an ally when they could have targeted you, Use a Method: you become the target instead.","epic_method_quick_talker","Epic Quick Talker","method_quick_talker",B.ar),A.bj("When you trigger your rainbow weaver gain advantage instead.","After you succeed an attack during your turn, you may heal an ally within range 6 of you {Half Level d6}.","epic_method_rainbow_weaver","Epic Rainbow Weaver","method_rainbow_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("You may move past any character attempting to block you.","You may move through enemies. When you scooch an ally, they gain {Half Level d6} shield. When you scooch an enemy, deal {Half Level d8} damage.","epic_method_scooch","Epic Scooch","method_scooch",B.ar),A.bj("Use a method: Describe a person who has a strong grudge with you, who has come to get revenge and will destroy anyone in their way. They always arrive behind your enemies.","When you succeed on an attack with advantage or have at least 1 ally to the target, give them {Half level} d6 bleed and until the start of your next turn, you do not provoke attacks.","epic_method_scoundrel","Epic Scoundrel","method_scoundrel",B.ar),A.bj("Your smite can kill the target or restrain the target for a while in a way that you are clearly responsible.","Your smite also targets enemies range 1 of the target. At the end of your turn, roll a d8 and on success, trigger your smite for free.","epic_method_smite","Epic Smite","method_smite",B.ar),A.bj("You may instead cause an unheld carriable object you can see teleport to your hand.","Use a Method: Target an enemy range {Level} who has a weapon or implement, disable them until they can grapple you or you drop it.","epic_method_snatch","Epic Snatch","method_snatch",B.ar),A.bj("You keep a thread of the soul of each person you kill. Use a method: don the appearance of one of your soul threads for the rest of the scene.","When you activate your soul adorn: target an enemy you can see and pull them to a free space adjacent to you. Then gain soul shards equal to the number of turns the target has.\nWhen you destroy a shard: Also gain {Soul Shards d12} shield and deal that much damage to the target and each enemy adjacent to you.","epic_method_soul_adorn","Epic Soul Adorn","method_soul_adorn",B.ar),A.bj("Whenever you feast on a soul, lose all stress. Whenever you gain stress gain 1 extra unless you have feasted during the scene.","When you activate soul feaster: target an enemy you can see. You become untargetable by allies and enemies, and enter the target. On the start of your next turn, gain soul shards equal to the number of turns the target has, heal {Soul Shards d10} and deal the same amount as damage to the target. Then place yourself in a free space adjacent to the target. If you wouldn\u2019t heal for being max health, gain that much shield instead.","epic_method_soul_feaster","Epic Soul Feaster","method_soul_feaster",B.ar),A.bj("When you make eye contact with someone, you can steal a thread of their soul. You know where they are for the remainder of the story.","When you activate Soul Reaper, target an enemy you can see. Gain soul shards equal to the number of turns the target has, the target takes {Soul Shards d12} damage ignoring shield and resistance. For the rest of the situation gain +{soul shards} range on all attacks.","epic_method_soul_reaper","Epic Soul Reaper","method_soul_reaper",B.ar),A.bj("Use a method: bloom mushrooms that fill a room, ship, or location. The location becomes difficult to navigate and machines there are jammed until the mushrooms are cleared. You may also have the mushrooms release hallucinogenic aerosols causing all characters who encounter them to make Vit defenses less they hallucinate.","when you succeed on an attack or status check, give the target spores. At the end of the round, every spore blooms, target each creature within 2 of a spore carrier, targeting nothing more than once, enemies take {half level d6} damage and allies heal equal to the damage.","epic_method_spore_spreader","Epic Spore Spreader","method_spore_spreader",B.ar),A.bj("Whenever you use a supply and then plug a sponsor for it at least three times, Use a method: gain a Cash.","Once a creature has died, Use a method: to have chat tell you its defenses and max hp.","epic_method_streamer","Epic Streamer","method_streamer",B.ar),A.bj("When you use your stride, you may bring any creature physically touching you with.","After you are attacked, teleport {half level} spaces. Once per turn, When you teleport, you may bring an adjacent creature to you to a free space adjacent to your destination.","epic_method_stride","Epic Stride","method_stride",B.ar),A.bj("Your summons give a +1 to all skills, and they always arrive at the start of the scene.","When your summons damage enemies, they now deal {Half Level d6} damage for every summon in range of the enemy.","epic_method_summoner","Epic Summoner","method_summoner",B.ar),A.bj("You make a portal instead of a hole allowing you to not harm the surface nor leave evidence. The portal may pull you or your allies through if they are nearby.","whenever you succeed a defense for a melee attack, Use a method: move through them to a free space on the other side and deal them {Level d12} damage.","epic_method_through","Epic Through","method_through",B.ar),A.bj("After finding out the truth, you may ask a yes or no question that must be answered truthfully.","You also find out what its current and max health is.","epic_method_truth_seeker","Epic Truth Seeker","method_truth_seeker",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: you ask the DM what would be required to convince an NPC to do something and they must truthfully explain.","the DM also tells you how dangerous the enemies you are facing relative to your power and explains which enemies are strong against who.","epic_method_understanding","Epic Understanding","method_understanding",B.ar),A.bj("Whenever you stand still while wall walking, you become invisible.","While wall walking you don\u2019t provoke attacks and can move through enemies.","epic_method_wall_walker","Epic Wall Walker","method_wall_walker",B.ar),A.bj("When an ally makes a defense caused by a character, Use a method: attack that character giving them a debilitating wound. Describe how their wound impedies them.","Once during each of your turns, make a weapon attack with a source value of {level} and +1 to success. This doesn\u2019t count toward your normal warrior limit.","epic_method_warrior","Epic Warrior","method_warrior",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: You cause a tsunami that can wash away vehicles, and move buildings.","When you succeed on attacks until the start of your next turn, enemies targeted take {Half level d6} bonus damage from attacks and have their speed reduced by half. When you succeed on a check to heal Allies, the targeted ally gains {Half Level d6} shield and deal {Half level d6} extra damage on attacks until the start of your next turn.","epic_method_water_weaver","Epic Water Weaver","method_water_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: You cause plants to overtake a building, or grab hold of a ship or vehicle. Until destroyed, these plants obey you and will try to restrain any characters or devices of your choice.","When you make a ranged attack you may target from any weed. When you make a melee attack, you may target it from each weed targeting no enemy more than once. At the end of each of your turns, turn 1 free space into weeds.","epic_method_weed_weaver","Epic Weed Weaver","method_weed_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("Use a Method: You can control the wind at a scale that can cause tornados that can level buildings and crash ships in atmo.","Whenever you succeed on an attack or status check, you may force dash you or the targets up to {Half Level} spaces in the same direction.","epic_method_wind_weaver","Epic Wind Weaver","method_wind_weaver",B.ar),A.bj("When you succeed any skill that enables you to get in melee range of a character, you may sting them causing them to be paralysed.","whenever you succeed on an attack or status check, give the target { Level /3} d10 Burn vs Vit.","epic_method_venomous","Epic Venomous","method_venomous",B.ar),A.bj("At the start of every situation, gain {Innate Feature pts /3} Rerolls.","Once a Round, on your turn, you may take an extra action. You may do this {Innate Feature pts /3} times each encounter.","epic_source_innate","Epic Innate","source_innate",B.cO),A.bj("When your allies fail skills you may have your companions make the check instead. Whenever you gain downtime, gain 1 extra.","Once per turn, when 1 of your companions would use their [Minion], instead have them activate one of their companions.","epic_source_companion","Epic Companion","source_companion",B.cO),A.bj("You can always make a craft after a skill check. When you roll a defense, you may use a craft to gain advantage if the defense is the same stat attribute as the skill.","Pick 1 ingredient effect as a secret ingredient, adding its effect whenever you use ingredients. You may not benefit from an ingredient effect twice. If you pick an ingredient that you already have, gain a new ingredient.\nBefore an ally within {Half Level} activates an Ability, you may spend 1 or 2 ingredients to give their ability the benefit of the ingredient effects. Allies do not get your secret ingredient bonus but you may have any ingredient provide the secret ingredients effect instead.","epic_source_craft","Epic Crafting","source_craft",B.cO),A.bj("Your allies in the situation with you may also adopt your Adventuring form, gaining the same benefits. At the start of every situation, you gain 2 skill reroll and gain 1 addition reroll for each ally who adopts your form.","Pick an aspect, choosing any of the form ability options. When in your form, when allies who are within {Half Level} spaces of you spend their [Action] and succeed on an attack, you may apply your aspect effect to them. When you Succeed on a Reaction apply your aspect effect.","epic_source_form","Epic Form","source_form",B.cO),A.bj("You may use each of your gadgets twice before needing to repair them.","You may use each of your gadgets 2 times before needing to repair them. When you repair a gadget, replenish both usages. When you use a gadget, you may expend an additional usage of this gadget or a usage of another gadget to gain a +2 Source mod to the ability.","epic_source_gadgets","Epic Gadgets","source_gadgets",B.cO),A.bj("When you pay a blessing, give one creature you can see 1 skill reroll. If you give an enemy 1 usage you regain 1 use of your blessing.","After you make your situation roll, You may pay 1 usage of granted power to pick 1 of your methods instead. Whenever you would die, you may spend a usage of granted power, to instead become full HP. [Action], you may spend a usage of granted power to target an ally you can see and give them their Max Shield. [Action], you may spend a usage of granted power and target an adjacent ally's body who died this round. Immediately respawn the ally there, setting their HP to half.","epic_source_granted_power","Epic Granted Power","source_granted_power",B.cO),A.bj("After you have warmed up a skill, your allies in the situation with you also gain the +1 bonus to results of that skill.","You gain an extra overheat effect called your Epic Overheat, whenever you gain 1 heat, your Epic Overheat gains 2 heat. Every time you trigger your Epic Overheat, gain a +1 source mod to heat abilities for the rest of the encounter, up to a max of {Level/3}. Your epic overheat may be an overheat effect you have already chosen.","epic_source_heat","Epic Heat","source_heat",B.cO),A.bj("When you spend MP on a skill, gain +1 to the result. When you spend MP to give allies advantage, they gain a +1 to the result.","Whenever you succeed on an attack or status check caused by an ability you spent MP on, you may spend up to {Half Level} MP to trigger one of the below effects using that spent MP. Do not include the MP spent to trigger the ability.\nDeal {MP d6} damage to an enemy within {MP}.\nTarget an ally range {MP} and either heal {MP d6} or gain {MP d6} shield.\nTarget 1 creature range {MP} and force them to dash {MP}","epic_source_intuitive_magic","Epic Intuitive Magic","source_intuitive_magic",B.cO),A.bj("You and your allies can use prepared skill spells to reroll skill checks of the prepared skill. When you finish a situation, Regain {Prepared Magic pts /3} MP.","Once per round, After you use your [Action] to use a prepared magic feature, you may use a multicast to perform another prepared magic feature using an [Action] that is a different combat feature than the original action. You may use multicast {Prepared Magic pts / 3} times every encounter.","epic_source_prepared_magic","Epic Prepared Magic","source_prepared_magic",B.cO),A.bj("You may pay 1 ki to reroll skills you are proficient in, and you may pay 2 ki to reroll skills you are not proficient in.","Gain a +1 bonus to your source for all your ki abilities. When you spend your reaction, you may pay 1 ki to regain your reaction. When you fail a defense, you may spend 1 ki to reroll.","epic_source_ki","Epic Ki","source_ki",B.cO),A.bj("You can sacrifice to aid any ally even when you're not in the scene with them. When you do, you pay the cost at the start of the next scene instead. If you do that enough that the total cost would kill you at the start of the next scene, you can no longer sacrifice this scene and all allies gain +1 to all skills for the remainder of the scene. Instead of dying at the start, the DM decides when you die suddenly.","Once per ability per story, you can sacrifice the use of a sacrifice ability for the remainder of the story. When you do, trigger it with a source value of {9}, and gain advantage on any attacks or status checks for that ability.","epic_source_vice","Epic Sacrifice","source_vice",B.cO),A.bj("Whenever you make a check and don\u2019t spend stamina, gain 1 stamina.","When you succeed on an attack that costs stamina, regain half the spent Stamina. Whenever you succeed on a defense, regain {Power / 3} stamina points. You may spend up to {Power +2} stamina on features.","epic_source_stamina","Epic Stamina","source_stamina",B.cO),A.bj("You may mutate {Mutation Pts} times per story instead. You may spend a mutation to let an ally you can touch mutate their skill proficiencies for the remainder of the scene.","For 1 of your mutations, you may have 1 extra upgrade. At the start of your turn you may Reorganize: lose any number of your current mutations, and regain evolution points equal to their cost.","epic_source_mutation","Epic Mutation","source_mutation",B.cO),A.bj("","Roll and track {Half Chronomancy} results for {Half Chronomancy} defenses and {Half Chronomancy} skills you aren't proficient in. Prediction: Before a creature makes a check, [Reaction] and give them one of your applicable chronomancy results for that check as if you had used it.","epic_source_time","Epic Time","source_time",B.cO),A.bj("When you or an ally you can see would make a skill check, you may spend 2 Psi points to have them use your check or use a willing ally you can see skill check instead.","You may concentrate on {Level /3} additional psy abilities, when you lose concentration on one you lose contraction on all. When you succeed on an attack, deal 1d12 extra damage for each ability you are concentrating on.\nYou may spend 1 Psi point when you activate a psi ability to target the ability from a free space within {Half total Psi Pts} or from the space of any ally.\nWhen an ally who is within {Half total Psionic points} uses an ability, you may pay Psi points to apply one of your Psi abilities to the attack.","epic_source_psionics","Epic Psionics","source_psionics",B.cO),A.bj("Work Blend: Select 4 skills when to take this. While high you have a +1 to skill results of the selected skills. You always have a -1 to skill results for the skills you didn\u2019t select.","While high, you resist all damage but have disadvantage on defense checks. You gain a bonus based on the addiction mod.\nQuick: While high, gain {Level / 3} Speed.\nStrong: While high, deal {Level / 3 d6} Extra damage on all attacks.\nHomemade: While high, As a [Action] You may make a create check. On Success, make {Power} Drugs and give them to an ally range 4. Your allies may consume Drugs as an item interaction to gain Resistance to all damage until the start of their next turn.","epic_addict","Epic Addict","trait_addict",B.bV),A.bj("When you succeed on a skill check without a bonus, +1 to result, a reroll, or advantage, gain 1 confidence reroll. When you fail a skill, lose all confidence rerolls.","When you Succeed on an attack, Roll and deal your confidence as bonus damage to the attack's targets, Then gain {1d6} confidence. When you succeed on a defense, Roll and gain your confidence as shield, Then gain {1d6} Confidence. When you fail an attack or defense, lose all your confidence.","epic_confidence","Epic Confidence","trait_confidence",B.bV),A.bj("If you complete a situation and failed at least 1 check, gain 1 downtime.","You have resistance to damage caused by characters who, since your last turn, you have not targeted with an attack or status check. You have advantage on concentration checks caused by damage you resisted via epic distractible.","epic_distractible","Epic Distractible","trait_distractible",B.bV),A.bj("during a situation, you may reroll a skill with a +1 to the result if you forget a skill for the rest of the situation. If you see forced to make a forgotten skill, you fail automatically.","On the start of your turn, target 1 enemy and 1 ally. The targets may not target you with any of their abilities until the start of your next turn nor may you target them. If the enemy has multiple turns, choose 1 turn to be forgotten.\nOnce each encounter, When you activate an ability, you may forget one of your combat features for the rest of the encounter. You gain a source mod of {Half the features pts} for the remainder of the encounter. Mutations instead may pay up to 3 evolution points instead, gaining a source mod of {Half amount paid} for the remainder of the encounter.","epic_forgetful","Epic Forgetful","trait_forgetful",B.bV),A.bj("Before each skill check, flip a coin, Heads you have advantage and gain a reroll, tails disadvantage. You may not have more than {Half Level} rerolls.","At the Start of your turn, Roll 2d6. If you don\u2019t roll a 7, Gain {Level d6} Shield and gain {Half Level d8} Bonus damage on all attacks. If you roll a 7, you are stunned.\nSupply: the first time you fail a check in a round, spend a supply and roll 2d6. On a 7 you succeed, otherwise gain nothing.","epic_gambler","Epic Gambler","trait_gambler",B.bV),A.bj("Up to {Half Level} times per situation, your allies may use your skill rating when making a skill check.","When an ally within 4 takes damage, you may give them resistance to the damage, and you take the same amount of damage. When you target an ally with an effect, you may give them any amount of your HP and Shield. When you use either effect, at The start of the target's next turn, they heal {Half Level d6}.","epic_giving","Epic Giving","trait_giving",B.bV),A.bj("You have advantage on checks to assist your allies.","Allies adjacent to you have advantage on attacks and skill checks.","epic_helpful","Epic Helpful","trait_helpful",B.bV),A.bj("Up to {Half Level} Times per situation, you may reroll a skill check by making a different skill check.","Once during your turn, Up to {Half Level} times each encounter, When you fail with using your [Action], you may activate a different feature instead. Up to {Half Level} times each encounter, when you fail a defense, you may reroll using a different defense.","epic_impulsive","Epic Impulsive","trait_impulsive",B.bV),A.bj("when you fail a defense other than dex and have your keepsake. You may reroll the defense.","If you or an ally you can see would die and you have your keepsake, they instead set their HP to half. You may do this {Level /3} times per situation. If your keepsake is destroyed, any characters saved by it make a Vitality defense and die on a failure.","epic_keepsake","Epic Keepsake","trait_keepsake",B.bV),A.bj("you have {Half Level} backup plans. For each backup plan, pick 1 character, and a skill. When the character fails at the selected skill, reveal your backup plan and have another character make the skill check with a +1 to the results.","you may make {Half Level} Plans. Before the encounter, for each plan, predict a character, a round, and a type of check (attack, defense, skill). If your prediction is correct, you may trigger the prediction, the named character gains the following effect based on the type of action.\nAttack, gain advantage on the attack and deal {Half Level d6} extra damage.\nDefense: gain advantage on the defense and {Half Level d6} shield, the target cannot be killed by the attack, if they would be killed they are set to half HP instead.\nSkill: the target has advantage and a +1 to the results.","epic_planner","Epic Planner","trait_planner",B.bV),A.bj("You have a +1 bonus to results and advantage on defenses. You have disadvantage on skills you aren\u2019t proficient in.","Impenetrable anxiety: When a character targets you with an ability, you may no longer be a target by the attack or ability until the start of your next turn. You may do this up to {Half Level} times per encounter.\nWhen you Succeed on an attack, if no enemy is adjacent, Deal {Half Level - remaining Usages of Impenetrable Anxiety d12} extra damage. If an enemy is adjacent, Reduce your damage by that amount instead.","epic_nervous","Epic Nervous","trait_nervous",B.bV),A.bj("when an ally fails a skill, you may attempt the skill instead. You may do this {Half level} times each situation.","You gain {Half Level} bonus reactions at the start of a combat situation that last until the end of the situation. You may use these reactions as reactions whenever they could be triggered, you still have 1 reaction per turn as normal.","epic_reactive","Epic Reactive","trait_reactive",B.bV),A.bj("you gain a +1 to the results of skills and defenses","you gain a +1 to the results of attack, defense, and skill checks","epic_relaxed","Epic Relaxed","trait_relaxed",B.bV),A.bj("whenever an ally uses your savant skill, they may use your rating instead. You gain +1 to the results of your savant skill and -1 to your results to non-savant skills.","At the start of your turn, make your savant skill. On success, choose an action from skills in combat and perform the action as a free action with a free supply to improve the action.","epic_savant","Epic Savant","trait_savant",B.bV),A.bj("when you spend a supply, flip a coin. On heads, you don't spend the supply.","whenever you use a [Action], pick a free space adjacent to you or one of the targets, and place a pile of scrap. The pile of scrap counts as a barrier. You may target a pile to make it into a wall of scrap, which is considered a wall. Once on your turn when adjacent to a pile or wall of scrap, you may destroy the scrap and target yourself or an ally range 3, and either gain a supply or give the target a shield, pile {Half Level d6} wall {Half level d12}. Once a turn, as a free action, you may destroy scrap you can see, and deal damage to an enemy adjacent to the scrap, deal {Half level d6} for a pile and {Half Level d12}.","epic_scrapper","Epic Scrapper","trait_scrapper",B.bV),A.bj("once a check, when an ally succeeds on a skill, you may force them to reroll the check and you gain 1 success. The next time you would make the same check, automatically succeed.\nWhen you fail a defense that any of your allies also had to make, you must swap results with an ally who succeeded if possible.","once a turn, when an ally succeeds a check. You can take the success, making them reroll the check. When you would next make that same check, use the success and succeed automatically. When the check is an attack it must include targets from the original attack. When the check is a defense or skill they must be the same specific defense or skill. Unused successes are lost at the end of the encounter.\nWhen you fail a defense that any of your allies also had to make, you must swap results with an ally who succeeded if possible.","epic_self_interested","Epic Self Interest","trait_self_interested",B.bV),A.bj("whenever you would have to make a convince check when with an ally, you may force the ally to make the check instead of you. You have disadvantage on convince checks when alone.","at the start of your turn, if there is no creature adjacent to you, You hide. Whenever you are no longer hidden, dash {Half Level} spaces.","epic_shy","Epic Shy","trait_shy",B.bV),A.bj("every situation, you and each ally character gains 1 reroll for any skill and 1 reroll for any defense.","you have social dice that start each turn as {Half Level d6}. On your turn, each time you become adjacent to an ally for the first time this turn, increase your social dice size once to a max of {Half level d12}. You may allow yourself and any ally you visited to spend your social dice in the following ways.\nWhen dealing damage, spend and add the dice to the damage.\nWhen failing a defense roll, spend and add the dice as shield before taking damage.\nWhen healing or granting shield, increase the amount by the spent dice.\n When you start your turn with unspent social dice, roll them and gain that amount as shield divided between yourself and your visited allies as you wish.","epic_social","Epic Social","trait_social",B.bV),A.bj("whenever you make a defense check, gain 1 skill reroll.","Whenever you are damaged by an attack or status check gain {Level/3 d6} adrenaline dice, if you are below half health gain {Level /3 d12} instead. Whenever you succeed in an attack, you may pay and roll adrenaline dice to give the targets that much extra damage and you gain that much shield. Whenever you are healed or gain shields, you may pay and roll adrenaline to heal or gain that much shield. Whenever an adjacent ally is targeted by an attack that doesn't include you as a target, you are attacked instead. When you succeed on a defense, you may choose to be hit by the attack but take half damage, Resistance is still applied.","epic_thrill_seeker","Epic Reckless","trait_thrill_seeker",B.bV),A.bj("you have {Half Level} gizmos that you regain at the end of a situation. Each gismo is assigned 2 skills, 1 of which you must be proficient in. A character can use the gismo to gain a +1 to the results of the selected skills. A gismo may be used as a supply.","at the end of the round, Make a create check, on success create a new contraption and keep or give it to any ally whenever they are adjacent. The contraption can be activated as a free action and has the effect of a skill in combat [Action] of your choice with a free supply worth of improvements. You select the bonus when you make the contraption and you must pick a different bonus than you did last round. The contraption last for the situation.","epic_tinkerer","Epic Tinkerer","trait_tinkerer",B.bV),A.bj("Whenever violence could be used to solve a problem rather than another skill, you may roll your attack roll instead. These rolls count as a skill (violence) for the purposes of determining effects.","When you fail an attack, Defense, or skill check, or when you succeed a skill or defense, you must give a creature at range 4, {1d8} Bleed. You may target yourself. When you succeed on an attack that deals damage, roll your current bleed and burn dice and deal that much damage to the targets of the attack ignoring Shield and Resistance.","epic_violent","Epic Violent","trait_violent",B.bV)],t.Gv))
s($,"cws","c8N",()=>{var q=null,p="Use a Method: You stop everything and have a brief chat with your whole party, while the servers restart.",o="Reduce their speed by {Half Level}.",n=t.bD,m=t.s,l=t.nL,k=t.jY
return A.a([A.cD(B.ag,"Spend a Method: you launch yourself, an ally, or supplies into a situation.","Spend a Method: Target a 2 space radius, at the end of the next round, Each creature in the location takes {Half Level d12} Damage.","epic_method_artillery","method_artillery","Artillery",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Create a work of art that distracts anyone who sees it for at least a moment. You must describe the work, and defend that it is art to anyone you hear that claims otherwise.","Use a Method: Create artwork in an adjacent free space. The artwork is a barrier. Whenever an ally is within {Half Level} of an artwork, they gain +1 to Wis, Int, & Cha defenses and +1 to Study, Create, & Convince.","epic_method_artist","method_artist","Artist",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"In any scene or situation you are in, use a method: you may interject and force your ally or anyone talking to your ally, to step to the side and engage in a one on one talk with you for a few seconds. When you do, you must lead the talk with a question and the other party has no obligation to be truthful.","Use a method, Target an enemy you can see and begin concentrating. You and that enemy can only target each other, and anyone else attacking either of you has disadvantage.","epic_method_aside","method_aside","Aside",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Instead of making a skill check, use a method: your assistant does the check and automatically succeeds. Then make a Cha defense, on Problems, you must explain what problem your shortsighted assistant caused while they were succeeding at their task. Your assistant will only help you with skills related to your background or that you are proficient in.","Use a Method: Your assistant helps you when you're in a bind. They can end 1 of the following effects, Prone, Restrained, Disabled, or Stunned.","epic_method_assistant","method_assistant","Assistant",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You can hack a person you can see, getting their visual information for the rest of the scene or situation.","Use a Method: Target 1 enemy. While concentrating: You and your allies gain +1 Bonus to attack results against the target and defense results caused by the target.","epic_method_body_hacker","method_body_hacker","Body Hacker",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You get into any party, club, event, restaurant, celebration, or publicly accessible place where people are mingling. When you do, you must explain how your charity work linked you to someone who can get you in.","Use a Method: Until you make an attack or skill check, you have advantage on defenses. You must act indignantly when attacked.","epic_method_charitable","method_charitable","Charitable",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"When you first meet an NPC, use a method: you give them a snack. You have a +1 to convince results until you become a threat to them.","Use a Method: gain a snack or give an ally a snack that when eaten heals {Half Level d12}. You may eat a snack at any time during your turn.","epic_method_chef","method_chef","Chef",q,A.a([A.a4t(q,"Snack",q)],n)),A.cD(B.ag,"Whenever you can rest, use a method: you chill. You and all your allies have advantage on rest rolls, and either remove 1 exhaustion, or stress.","Use a Method: You relax yourself and all your allies gaining +1 to either your next Skill or Defense check.","epic_method_chill","method_chill","Chill",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: You call upon unnatural power to immediately solve a problem that would require a skill check. In a later scene or situation, the DM may remind you of your request, and you must describe an ironic problem to face now.","Use a method: Target 1 enemy you can see. You and the target gain either, {Level d6} bleed or burn, or Until the end of your next turn are Restrained, Disabled, or Stunned.","epic_method_dark_forces","method_dark_forces","Dark Forces",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Remind a character of their mortality without malice and compel them to engage in something they wish to do before dying. Describe what they go to do.","Use a Method: Target 2 Creatures you can see and deal {Half Level d12} Damage to them. You may target yourself.","epic_method_death_weaver","method_death_weaver","Death Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: You doom anyone you can see, by saying doom and then describing a purely negative fate that will befall them. The fate you doom them to will happen at an unknown time and whatever fate you choose will also happen to a random party member at an unknown time. Anyone who is doomed knows they are doomed, roll for the ally, including you, when you use this.","Use a Method: Randomly target 1 character of each faction involved in the combat, and doom them. Until the end of your next turn or for as long as you concentrate, all attacks against the targets deal {Half Level d8} extra damage.","epic_method_doom","method_doom","Doom",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You throw a flash smoke bomb at your feet, momentarily concealing yourself from view from people and cameras. If you were able to become concealed during that time, you may make a Conceal to hide, On problem or if you couldn\u2019t hide, describe where you failed to hide that was obviously a bad pick in hindsight.","Use a Method: You become hidden until the start of your next turn. At that time, if you are still concealed, you may remain hidden.","epic_method_disappear","method_disappear","Disappear",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: You or an ally regains 1 supply from a drone delivery.","When you use an ability using your [Action] or a [Reaction] during your or ally turns, Use a Method: use a drone to target the ability from any free space, and gain a +1 to attack & check results.","epic_method_drone","method_drone","Drone",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Set fire to any object you can see. You cannot conceal that you started the fire.","Use a Method: Target Yourself or An ally and give {Half Level} d6 Burn vs Dex damage to all enemies adjacent to the target. You may also deal {Half Level d6} damage to the enemy but must also deal that damage to the target. The target may also choose to gain the burn and gain {Half Level} bonus speed as long as they have the burn.","epic_method_fire_weaver","method_fire_weaver","Fire Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"When you enter a place with multiple unmet characters, Use a Method: you can run into a casual friend you have met. Explain where you met them and a joke from that meeting.","When you are attacked by an enemy you haven\u2019t attacked in this situation, Use a Method: mention that you are friends with someone you both know and get advantage on the defense.","epic_method_friends","method_friends","Friends",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"When you succeed a Conceal check to hide yourself, Use a Method: your allies may also succeed to conceal themselves. When you become revealed, you must say something ominous, then your friends become revealed.","Whenever an ally becomes hidden or starts their turn hidden, Use a Method: you teleport them to a free space adjacent to you.","epic_method_friends_in_the_shadows","method_friends_in_the_shadows","Friends in the Shadows",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You have {Level} Goons under your command during the scene. You can send a goon to attempt any check with a 1d6, or to do any task an average person in the setting can do. Each goon is good for one task and is willing to do harm and attack. When the goon rolls a 1 on a skill, the problems affect you rather than the goon.","When you succeed on an attack, Use a Method: have a medium sized Goon grapple 1 of the targets. The goon has 1 health and uses your defenses. At the start of your turn, make an attack roll for each grappling goon and deal {Level d6} damage. When the goon is no longer grappling they retreat.\nGenerally, Goons are Medium Pawn Chumps of the player\u2019s level.","epic_method_goons","method_goons","Goons",q,A.a([A.a4t("{Level}","Goons",q)],n)),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: You cause a device to catastrophically fail to your benefit by explaining what breaks and how it helps.","Use a method: Target an enemy you can see and a part of their body malfunctions. You and your allies have a +1 to attacks vs Str, Dex, and Vit, and defense from attacks that target the same defense until the target spends an action succeeding on a Create Check to fix it.","epic_method_gremlin","method_gremlin","Gremlin",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"If you have blood, vital essence, or any physical evidence left from a wound from a character. Use a method: you see the character and immediately around them in your mind. You also know their exact location as long as you have the sample.","After you succeed with a melee attack, Use a method: heal {half Level d8}.\nNova: Use a Method: Lose {Half Level d6} health ignoring shield and resistance then deal {Half level d12} damage to enemies within {Half Level} that ignores shield and resistance.","epic_method_hemomancer","method_hemomancer","Hemomancer",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Freeze an object solid, temporarily disabling it from use. You may unfreeze it at any time.","Use a Method: Target a {Half Level} space radius and give all enemies there {One Third Level} cold.","epic_method_ice_weaver","method_ice_weaver","Ice Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You force someone you can see to lose their temper to your benefit.","Use a Method: Target 1 enemy that can hear or see you. Until the start of your next turn or as long as you remain concentrating, On the target\u2019s turn they must target you with an attack if able.","epic_method_irritation","method_irritation","Irritation",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Heal or treat a wound or illness.","During your ally turns, Use a Method: Target yourself and all allies range 4, heal them {Half Level d6}. At the end of your next turn, repeat the heal.","epic_method_life_weaver","method_life_weaver","Life Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Either power any electrical device. Disable the power to a building or ship.","Use a Method: Target each enemy in a 1 space radius and deal {Half Level d6} Damage and knock them prone. If they are already prone, they take {Level d6} damage instead.","epic_method_lightning_weaver","method_lightning_weaver","Lightning Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You force a popup ad on all characters who can see you, momentarily distracting them. You must describe what the ad is.","Use a Method: You cover yourself in Ad holograms. You and your allies have +1 to attacks against and defenses from enemies within {Half Level} spaces of you.","epic_method_marketing","method_marketing","Marketing",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Whenever you would need to make a defense, Use a Method: make an attack roll instead to determine if you defend. You must explain how you use martial arts to defend yourself from the threat.","Use a Method: Either, Deal {Level d6} damage to 1 enemy range 1. Or until the start of your next turn, standing from prone costs you 1 movement (Easy Prone). After succeeding any attack, defense, or skill, you may dash 1 space.","epic_method_martial_artist","method_martial_artist","Martial Artist",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You create an undead minion who will go out to perform a single check using your skills. These undead minions can move as ghosts and wait for any length of time before emerging and doing the check. Describe how they jump scare anyone related to the check. Your minions can kill, and may attack instead of a skill.","Create 1 undead in a free space range 6 and make an attack to have it grapple an adjacent enemy. You may have up to a max of {Level / 3} undead. Undead are medium pawn chumps that use your defenses. Whenever an enemy provokes an attack from an undead, they are grappled instead. If a creature ends its turn grappled by an undead, it takes {Level d10} damage. During your turn, you may move each undead 4 spaces, and may make an attack to grapple with any undead that are within 1 of an enemy. Undead last for the situation. When your undead dies, during your turn, have it arise in a free space adjacent to you, it may then move and attack as normal.","epic_method_necromancer","method_necromancer","Necromancer",q,A.a([A.a4t("{Level / 3}","Undead",q)],n)),A.cD(B.ag,p,p,"epic_method_offline_chat","method_offline_chat","Offline Chat",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: You organize a non violent protest at a location for a cause of your choice. There are always some people who protest but the size of the event can vary based on the cause and who is being protested.","When you start your turn if there is an enemy effect that is reducing your speed, restraining, Disabled, Grappling, or Prone. Use a Method: End the effect and you deal {half Level d6} damage on your next attack against the causing enemy.","epic_method_oppose","method_oppose","Oppose",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You reveal your otherworldly form, describing what\u2019s unworldly about you. Anyone who sees it will doubt their own memory and people won\u2019t believe their testimony about the events you do while you're in your otherworldly form.","Use a Method: While concentrating, you gain resistance to attacks targeting Int, Wis, and Cha. The first time each round for each enemy, when they start their turn or become within 3 spaces of you, they take {Half Level d6} damage vs Int.","epic_method_otherworldly","method_otherworldly","Otherworldly",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Spend a Method: Overclock you or an ally. For the rest of the scene, they roll checks with +1 to success but they gain either 1 exhaustion or stress at the end of the encounter.","Target yourself or an ally. They gain a +1 to check results and at the start of their turn roll 1d6, taking that much damage and may move that many extra spaces on their turn. They may roll up to {Vitality} extra d6 for more extra movement.","epic_method_overclock","method_overclock","Overclock",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"If you have to make a defense but have not made any checks in this scene, Use a method: and succeed on the defense. Describe how you phased to avoid the check and doing this counts as a check for future defenses.","At the start of the round, Use a method: you may not be targeted with attacks until you have finished your turn and during your turn you do not provoke attacks and may move through enemy spaces. You may not use phasing when surprised.","epic_method_phasing","method_phasing","Phasing",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: You pocket sand someone incapacitating them momentarily or allowing you to reroll a defense from an attack.","Use a method: Target an enemy range 3, you & allies have advantage on defenses from that enemy and you & allies don\u2019t provoke attacks from that enemy until the start of your next turn.","epic_method_pocket_sand","method_pocket_sand","Pocket Sand",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: You poison a character by describing in what way you got them to consume the poison. The poison can:\nparalyze them briefly,\ncause them to vomit for a bit,\nhallucinate for a while.\nto sleep till tomorrow.","When you fail a defense from an attack, Use a method: give poison to an enemy within 1. At the end of their turn, make a Status Check vs Vit, On problems the effect ends. When you pick this, pick one of these effects.","epic_method_poisoner","method_poisoner","Poisoner",A.a([A.yT(q,q,o,"Slow"),A.yT(q,q,"You and allies resist damage caused by the target.","Weaken"),A.yT(q,q,"The targets take {Half Level d8} damage.","Deadly"),A.yT("Defense",A.a(["Str","Dex","Vit","Int","Wis","Cha"],m),"Choose a defense, you and your allies have advantage on attacks targeting that defense against the target.","Disable")],l),q),A.cD(B.ag,"Before an ally in a scene with you makes a defense, Use a method: you may make the defense instead, becoming the target.","Use a method: Gain {Vitality d6} Protection. As long as you have Protection, if you or an ally within 3 spaces would take damage, you may lose Protection as if it was Shield. You cannot have more protection than your max shield.","epic_method_protector","method_protector","Protector",q,A.a([A.a4t(q,"Protection",q)],n)),A.cD(B.ag,"When you fail a convince, Use a Method: you toss to a present ally and have them try to convince both verbally then by rolling. If an ally fails to convince, you may step in and attempt to convince. Quick talker may only be applied to a roll 1 time.","When you fail a defense, Use a Method: you may have an adjacent ally become the target and make a defense. When an adjacent ally fails a defense, you may become the target and make a defense. Quick talker may not be applied more than once per attack.","epic_method_quick_talker","method_quick_talker","Quick Talker",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Until the end of the scene, the first time you make a skill check with each of the skills, gain a +1 to the result.","When you succeed an attack, Use a method: do one of the below based on which defense the attack targets.\nStr: knock the targets prone and push them {Half Level} spaces.\nDex: Give the targets {Half Level} d6 Bleed.\nVit: Deal {Half Level} d8 extra damage.\nInt: deal {Half Level d6} damage to enemies within 2 of the target, excluding the target.\nWis: reduce the target's speed by {Half Level} until the start of your next turn.\nCha: Give an ally range {Level} of the target or you, {Half Level d6} shield.","epic_method_rainbow_weaver","method_rainbow_weaver","Rainbow Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You move any object or character to any place they can fit in the same room.","Use a Method: Until the end of your turn, You move any object or character adjacent to you to another free space adjacent to you where they can fit. You may only move each target 1 time.","epic_method_scooch","method_scooch","Scooch",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: you hardware lock another character into their current body until they can get to the spawner. You have +1 to checks to threaten them. You need to get close or surprise them to lock them.","If you make an attack with a single target and either: have advantage or at least 1 ally adjacent to the target, Use a Method: Deal {Half Level d8} extra damage and either: Restrain, or Disable them until the start of your next turn.","epic_method_scoundrel","method_scoundrel","Scoundrel",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"After a character makes an ally make a defense check, Use a method: smite them. Smite is either a successful attack or For the remainder of the scene, your allies have +1 to defenses caused by the character.","Target 1 enemy and deal {Half Level d12} damage.","epic_method_smite","method_smite","Smite",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You make any one object that you held in one hand today fly to your hand. It must have a clear path, and will not harm you or anyone else by its flight. A container that can be held in one hand is a valid target and will bring the contents without harming them.","Use a Method: You cause an unheld carriable object range {Level} to teleport to your hand.","epic_method_snatch","method_snatch","Snatch",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"When you kill someone, Use a Method: you steal their appearance for the remainder of the scene.","Use a method: become soul adorn until the end of the situation gaining 1 soul shard. At the end of the round, if at least 1 character died that round, gain 1 soul shard up to {2 * Level} max shards. Then gain {Soul Shards d6} shield and Either: pull an enemy you can see {2 * Soul Shards} spaces, or force an enemy you can see to move {Soul Shards} Spaces.\nDestroy Soul Shard: At the end of an enemy\u2019s turn, if you can see the enemy, Either, Pull them {2 * Soul Shards} spaces or force them to move {Soul Shards} spaces then lose 1 Soul Shard.\nYou lose all soul shards at the end of the encounter. Taking soul shard generating methods multiple times doesn\u2019t increase the number of shards you gain per round or start with.","epic_method_soul_adorn","method_soul_adorn","Soul Adorn",q,A.a([B.vW],n)),A.cD(B.ag,"When you kill someone, Use a method: you feast on their soul. You gain rest, and reduce 1 stress.","Spend a method and become a soul feaster until the end of the situation gaining 1 soul shard. At the end of the round, if at least 1 character died that round, gain 1 soul shard up to {2 * Level} max shards. Then heal {Soul Shards d6}. If you are then full health gain {Half Soul Shards} speed.\nDestroy Soul Shard: After taking damage, you may heal {Soul Shards d6} then lose 1 soul shard. You must survive the attack to use this.\nYou lose all soul shards at the end of the encounter. Taking soul shard generating methods multiple times doesn\u2019t increase the number of shards you gain per round or start with.","epic_method_soul_feaster","method_soul_feaster","Soul Feaster",q,A.a([B.vW],n)),A.cD(B.ag,"After killing someone, Use a method: become invisible and silent for a short time.","Use a method: become a Soul Reaper until the end of the situation gaining 1 soul shard. At the end of the round, if at least 1 character died that round, gain 1 soul shard up to {2 * Level} max shards. When you attack using your action and succeed, deal {Soul Shards d6} extra damage, if the target is Prone, Restrained, Disabled, or Stunned, deal {Soul Shards d8} instead.\nDestroy Soul: After Succeeding an Attack that doesn\u2019t have the benefit of your soul reaper. Deal extra damage as if you had triggered your soul reaper, then lose 1 soul shard.\nYou lose all soul shards at the end of the encounter. Taking soul shard generating methods multiple times doesn\u2019t increase the number of shards you gain on kill or start with.","epic_method_soul_reaper","method_soul_reaper","Soul Reaper",q,A.a([B.vW],n)),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a method: infect an object with spores. The spores are invisible and you may see from them. You may at any time bloom the spores into mushrooms which destroy anything organic and disable any machine until removed.","Use a method: place a spore on yourself or an ally. When the target succeeds an attack or defense, you may remove the spore and deal {Half Level d6} damage to enemies adjacent to the target and heal allies adjacent to the target the same amount.","epic_method_spore_spreader","method_spore_spreader","Spore Spreader",q,q),A.cD(A.a([A.h7("You must share personal or compromising information about a party member during a scene.","complication_streamer_on_camera","On Camera")],k),"Use a Method: You have your stream subs or other internet friends study something for you, finding out information obtainable as if they had spent downtime studying.","Use a Method: Get a simple reminder about something in the situation that you forgot from the DM. If there isn\u2019t, either regain the method or gain 1 speed until the start of your next turn.","epic_method_streamer","method_streamer","Streamer",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Spend a Method then You teleport a short distance to a place you can see.","Spend a Method then until the start of your next turn you teleport up to your speed instead of moving. At the Start of the round, you may teleport to a free space range {Level}.","epic_method_stride","method_stride","Stride",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"At the start of any scene involving you or a party member, Use a method: send your summons to help them. You and any party members in the scene gain a +1 to any skills that you are proficient in. The DM may delay the arrival of summons in the scene, if they arrive after any checks are made, regain the method and describe how your summons return let down.","Use a Method: While concentrating on Summoning, at the start of your turn, place a Summon into a free space within 6, then move all your summons up to 6 spaces. Then any enemy adjacent to at least 1 Summon takes {Half Level d6} damage. Summons are Medium Pawn Chumps that use your defenses. You may have at most {Half Level} summons, and summons last until the end of the situation.","epic_method_summoner","method_summoner","Summoner",q,A.a([A.a4t("{Half Level}","Summons",q)],n)),A.cD(A.a([A.h7("You must interrupt another player's skit to their detriment. They must become frustrated with you.","complication_through_another_side","There's another side?")],k),"Use a Method: You make a hole big enough for a character to fit through in any wall, floor or ceiling.","Use a Method: You move through enemies' spaces until the start of your next turn. The first time you move through each enemy, deal them {Half Level d10} damage.","epic_method_through","method_through","Through",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You ask someone if what they said was a lie, and they must tell you if it was. Then you must truthfully explain why you're asking.","Use a Method: You can ask either what defenses all their abilities target, or what defenses they resist and get a truthful answer.","epic_method_truth_seeker","method_truth_seeker","Truth Seeker",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You know what a character you can see currently wants, and if they are a threat to you or your allies.","Use a Method: the DM tells you clearly what the objectives currently are for the situation you are in.","epic_method_understanding","method_understanding","Understanding",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You may walk on any wall or ceiling for the remainder of the scene.","While concentrating, when you end your turn adjacent to a wall or are on the ceiling you are wall walking. While wall walking gain +1 to Str, Dex, Vitality defenses and +1 to attacks that target those defenses. You cannot be flanked. You still block your space while on the walls or most ceilings.\nIf the ceiling is too tall to make melee attacks, you don\u2019t block the space but use the space at ground level below you for deciding range subtracting 1 from the range. Your ranged attacks you make have disadvantage, and ranged attacks against you have disadvantage.","epic_method_wall_walker","method_wall_walker","Wall Walker",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: make a threat. For the rest of the scene, as long as you are holding your weapon, you and your allies gain +1 to Convince, and +1 to Cha defense.","During your turn, spend a method then Target an enemy with a weapon you are holding. Make a Weapon Attack with a source value of {level} and +1 to success. You may only trigger this {Source /4} times each turn.","epic_method_warrior","method_warrior","Warrior",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Summon a wave of water that crashes through the room moving objects and characters about. Most devices are waterproof but anything that can\u2019t handle being suddenly moved is broken.","Target a 1 space radius and each enemy there becomes Soggy until the end of the next round. While soggy, You and Your allies deal {Half Level d6} Damage whenever they Succeed with an Attack or Status Check that deals damage against the target.","epic_method_water_weaver","method_water_weaver","Water Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: Cause plants to grow and restrain a creature or device.","When you succeed on an attack, spend a method and choose 1 of the targets, placing a weed in one of their spaces and restraining them until the start of your next turn. The weeds are difficult terrain for your enemies and last for the situation or till destroyed. You may target Melee attacks from the location of the weeds.","epic_method_weed_weaver","method_weed_weaver","Weed Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You create a strong gust of wind that blast all characters and loose objects in a room sized area. You cannot exclude targets from the areas you affect.","Use a method: Target yourself and up to {Half Level} other creatures and force them to dash up to {Level} spaces all in the same direction.","epic_method_wind_weaver","method_wind_weaver","Wind Weaver",q,q),A.cD(B.ag,"Use a Method: You dart an enemy, causing them to fall asleep till tomorrow. The first time each scene you use this while hiding, you don\u2019t break your concealment.","When you succeed on an attack, Use a method: Give the targets your Venom. At the end of their turn, make a Status check vs Vit, on Problems end the effect. When you pick this, choose one of the below effects for your venom.","epic_method_venomous","method_venomous","Venomous",A.a([A.yT(q,q,o,"Slow"),A.yT(q,q,"The target halves all healing and shields.","Sicken"),A.yT(q,q,"The targets take {Half Level d6} extra damage.","Deadly"),A.yT("Defense",A.a(["Str","Dex","Vit","Int","Wis","Cha"],m),"on a Melee only, Choose a defense, you and your allies have advantage on attacks targeting that defense against the target.","Disable")],l),q)],A.aq("A<f1>"))})
